{"page":473,"verses":[{"verse_key":"40:50","surah":40,"ayah":50,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟ أَوَلَمْ تَكُ تَأْتِيكُمْ رُسُلُكُم بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ ۖ قَالُوا۟ بَلَىٰ ۚ قَالُوا۟ فَٱدْعُوا۟ ۗ وَمَا دُعَـٰٓؤُا۟ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ إِلَّا فِى ضَلَـٰلٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but they will say, ‘Did your messengers not come to you with clear evidence of the truth?’ They will say, ‘Yes they did,’ and the keeper will say, ‘You can plead, then, but the pleas of disbelievers will always be in vain.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"They (will) say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Did there not","transliteration":"awalam","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَكُ","en_gloss":"Did there not","transliteration":"taku","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَأْتِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"come to you","transliteration":"tatīkum","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رُسُلُكُم","en_gloss":"your Messengers","transliteration":"rusulukum","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ ۖ","en_gloss":"with clear proofs","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They (will) say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَلَىٰ ۚ","en_gloss":"Yes","transliteration":"balā","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They (will) say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَٱدْعُوا۟ ۗ","en_gloss":"Then call","transliteration":"fa-id'ʿū","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"but not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":12,"ar":"دُعَـٰٓؤُا۟","en_gloss":"(is the) call","transliteration":"duʿāu","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ضَلَـٰلٍ","en_gloss":"error","transliteration":"ḍalālin","verse_key":"40:50"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٥٠","en_gloss":"(50)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"40:50"}]},{"verse_key":"40:51","surah":40,"ayah":51,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّا لَنَنصُرُ رُسُلَنَا وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَيَوْمَ يَقُومُ ٱلْأَشْهَـٰدُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We support Our messengers and the believers, in the present life and on the Day when witnesses arise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"40:51"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَنَنصُرُ","en_gloss":"We will surely help","transliteration":"lananṣuru","verse_key":"40:51"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رُسُلَنَا","en_gloss":"Our Messengers","transliteration":"rusulanā","verse_key":"40:51"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"and those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"40:51"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"40:51"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"40:51"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","verse_key":"40:51"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"40:51"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"and (on the) Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"40:51"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَقُومُ","en_gloss":"(when) will stand","transliteration":"yaqūmu","verse_key":"40:51"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْأَشْهَـٰدُ","en_gloss":"the witnesses","transliteration":"l-ashhādu","verse_key":"40:51"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٥١","en_gloss":"(51)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"40:51"}]},{"verse_key":"40:52","surah":40,"ayah":52,"ar_uthmani":"يَوْمَ لَا يَنفَعُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ مَعْذِرَتُهُمْ ۖ وَلَهُمُ ٱللَّعْنَةُ وَلَهُمْ سُوٓءُ ٱلدَّارِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day when excuses will not profit the evildoers, their fate will be rejection and they will have the worst of homes.","words":[{"pos":1,"a